; A lot fixated from a total cost, `23 AAPL @@ =$23.60` ($1.026087 a
; unit), and a lot typed as 10 AAPL {=$1.03} on the same day are one lot
; when the typed lot comes second, and two when it comes first.  -p picks
; one order per block.
;
; Typed first (2020), the two stay apart, as in 3.4.1: fixating the
; computed lot looks up its fixated annotation exactly, so a computed
; price is never folded into a typed one that merely rounds alike.
; Folding it would make Assets:Broker hold 23 AAPL {=$1.03}, which print
; writes as `23 AAPL {=$1.03} [2020/01/01] @@= $23.6` and which reads
; back as a purchase for $23.69.
;
; Computed first (2021), the typed lot names the computed one, so
; Assets:Typed holds 10 AAPL {=$1.026087} and print writes it so: a typed
; lot price names a lot computed from a cost when the two prices agree to
; the lesser of their precisions (#524, added after 3.4.1), and that
; matching now reaches fixated lots.  It used to miss them, and leave the
; two lots apart in this order too, because `@ =` fixated the computed
; lot in place, so the lot stayed filed under its unfixated annotation,
; while the matching pairs only lots that are fixated alike.

2020/01/01 Typed lot
    Assets:Typed     10 AAPL {=$1.03} [2020/01/01]
    Equity:Opening

2020/01/01 Buy fixated
    Assets:Broker    23 AAPL @@ =$23.60
    Assets:Cash

2021/01/01 Buy fixated
    Assets:Broker    23 AAPL @@ =$23.60
    Assets:Cash

2021/01/01 Typed lot
    Assets:Typed     10 AAPL {=$1.03} [2021/01/01]
    Equity:Opening

test bal --lots -p 2020
                          $-23.60
23 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2020/01/01]
    10 AAPL {=$1.03} [2020/01/01]  Assets
23 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2020/01/01]    Broker
             $-23.60    Cash
10 AAPL {=$1.03} [2020/01/01]    Typed
-10 AAPL {=$1.03} [2020/01/01]  Equity:Opening
--------------------
                          $-23.60
23 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2020/01/01]
end test

test print -p 2020
2020/01/01 Typed lot
    Assets:Typed                        10 AAPL {=$1.03} [2020/01/01]
    Equity:Opening

2020/01/01 Buy fixated
    Assets:Broker                            23 AAPL @@= $23.6
    Assets:Cash
end test

test bal --lots -p 2021
                          $-23.60
33 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2021/01/01]  Assets
23 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2021/01/01]    Broker
             $-23.60    Cash
10 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2021/01/01]    Typed
-10 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2021/01/01]  Equity:Opening
--------------------
                          $-23.60
23 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2021/01/01]
end test

test print -p 2021
2021/01/01 Buy fixated
    Assets:Broker                            23 AAPL @@= $23.6
    Assets:Cash

2021/01/01 Typed lot
    Assets:Typed                        10 AAPL {=$1.026087} [2021/01/01]
    Equity:Opening
end test
